sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant CLI as odh-cli<br/>(kubectl-odh)
    participant Client as Unified Client<br/>6 client types
    participant RBAC as RBAC Pre-flight<br/>SelfSubjectAccessReview
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OLM as OLM<br/>Subscriptions/CSVs
    participant CH as clusterhealth<br/>Library

    Note over User,CH: Subcommand: migrate (privileged operation)
    User->>CLI: kubectl odh migrate
    CLI->>Client: Create REST config<br/>from kubeconfig
    Client->>K8sAPI: Authenticate<br/>kubeconfig credential chain
    K8sAPI-->>Client: Auth OK
    CLI->>RBAC: Pre-flight check
    RBAC->>K8sAPI: POST SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>authorization/v1
    K8sAPI-->>RBAC: Allowed/Denied
    alt Denied
        RBAC-->>CLI: Insufficient permissions
        CLI-->>User: Error: missing RBAC
    else Allowed
        RBAC-->>CLI: Pre-flight passed
        CLI->>Client: Execute migration
        Client->>OLM: GET Subscriptions, CSVs,<br/>OperatorGroups
        OLM-->>Client: OLM resources
        Client->>K8sAPI: Create/Update resources
        K8sAPI-->>Client: Success
        CLI-->>User: Migration complete
    end

    Note over User,CH: Subcommand: events (streaming)
    User->>CLI: kubectl odh events --watch
    CLI->>Client: Create REST config
    Client->>K8sAPI: Authenticate
    K8sAPI-->>Client: Auth OK
    CLI->>CH: Batch fetch events<br/>(clusterhealth library)
    CH->>K8sAPI: GET /api/v1/events
    K8sAPI-->>CH: Event list
    CH-->>CLI: Aggregated events
    CLI-->>User: Display events

    loop Watch per namespace (reconnect: 5 retries, 1s-30s backoff)
        CLI->>K8sAPI: WATCH /api/v1/events<br/>?watch=1&resourceVersion=N<br/>WebSocket (WSS)
        K8sAPI-->>CLI: Event stream
        CLI-->>User: Real-time event output
    end

    Note over User,CH: Subcommand: lint / get / status
    User->>CLI: kubectl odh lint
    CLI->>Client: Create REST config
    Client->>K8sAPI: GET resources<br/>(Namespaces, CRDs, etc.)
    K8sAPI-->>Client: Resource data
    CLI-->>User: Lint results / status
